{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a6e8beaeed6f138f61a7f002b5001606e040efa8c03f0d19b326ab01c1cc5b56","ja":"朋花様！　どうしてハンカチ\n見ただけで、誰のものかわかるの！？","zh":"朋花大人！为什么光是看了\n手帕，就能知道是谁的呀！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b6dc1279e91505bdd17f818eb24b15accbf3ebeaf23ce48d281aecaf9d731352","ja":"どうしてでしょう～？　真美ちゃんは、\n答えを知ってるのではありませんか～？","zh":"这是为什么呢～？真美，\n你是不是知道答案呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ea7b020f1d238b0426bb484779d38d6c3f5be034f6bb889c1249baa9c0729918","ja":"もしかして……魔法で分かったの！？\nでも、さっき使えないって言ってたじゃん！","zh":"难不成……是用魔法看出来的！？\n可是，刚才不是还说用不了嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"038055d8f9a2b20559e7181de3619a216555f6b3bd6a4bc31cc163d044520c9d","ja":"うふふ……冗談です～。","zh":"呵呵……开个玩笑啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b9d34b4f3dd58cc65f0e508dea0f87f71566f40f297ba3f36aac69e77e18d86c","ja":"冗談って……魔法で分かったのが冗談なの？\nそれとも魔法が使えないって言った方？　どっち！？","zh":"开玩笑是说……用魔法看穿这点是开玩笑？\n还是说不会用魔法那句才是？到底是哪个啦！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"37139567178d410af36dcceba5fc5a44c2ef9202860d9f850293728c828f828a","ja":"それはですね……。","zh":"这个嘛……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5b2887851427655446ab12b5ea53d563f505029e096d0213fab5b87484302388","ja":"そ、それは……？","zh":"那、那是……？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fdf955635c8114e51212893b172f0ebec8c4c776c737fbf85198a84e2df6dd55","ja":"魔法で分かったのが冗談ですよ～。","zh":"“用魔法知道的”是开玩笑的啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"aae6076b990e32647bb5cdffe1b94ee67cb744aba12c9dd262b7a2c9cbc9a62f","ja":"カメラマンさんがこのハンカチで、汗をふきながら、\n一生懸命撮影されてたのを覚えていただけです～。","zh":"只是记得摄影师先生曾用这条手帕一边擦着汗，\n一边非常努力地拍摄而已啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"fdcaf82018e0be05d638f723ae4ef503aeaaa75ac42af973ed65969c95cc6a8f","ja":"なんだ、そういうことか～……。","zh":"什么嘛，原来是这么回事啊～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c040cb5bb2e804bc29f4fdc3608b263bcaf9f57065793241a6fd344c0d06b788","ja":"って、そんな細かいところまで見てたの！？","zh":"居然连那么细节的地方都看到了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d47a05a42f42616255e49a883d2dd0f9ef8edc3823c91e972b52a694acac36da","ja":"はい～。周囲の方に目を配るのは、\n聖母として、当然の行ないですから～。","zh":"好～的。关照周围的人，\n身为圣母本就是理所应当的行止～哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1103.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"62e47a94a3ee1f191d1aa3525249bd396da3ee03101a08550e5141329e620bd6","ja":"それはそれですごいって……。その聖母力って、\n魔法みたいだよ！　やっぱ朋花様は魔法使いだね！","zh":"话是那么说但也太厉害了……那种圣母之力，\n简直就像魔法一样！朋花大人果然是魔法使呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
